# Pixel touch-ups for the mood portraits, applied after pixelizing.
#
# The portraits are regenerated from assets/reference on every build, so fixes
# made directly in the PNGs would be lost. Put them here instead.
#
#   portrait NAME            the portrait the following lines apply to
#   X Y COLOR                one pixel
#   X1-X2 Y COLOR            a horizontal run (inclusive)
#
# Coordinates are portrait pixels (0–95). COLOR is RRGGBB or `clear`.
# Tip: colours from the portrait's own palette look best (see the comments).

portrait happy
# A full row of upper teeth instead of a single lone tooth.
32 61 d5c1b2          # tooth shade
33-40 61 eddcbf       # teeth
41 61 d5c1b2
33-40 62 5c2b29       # mouth inside below the teeth

portrait laughing
# Left closed eye was three rows thick; make it match the right eye (two rows).
26-29 39 d5754c       # eyelid skin

portrait content
# Dark lump inside the left lens.
20-21 41 8c4536
20-21 42 8c4536
# Lone tooth in a closed-lips smirk.
36 60 5c2b29
